ctions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2455735054/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2476994018","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2557#issuecomment-2476994018","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2557","id":2476994018,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86To-3i","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-14T17:17:47Z","updated_at":"2024-11-14T17:17:47Z","body":"Agreed, no substantial use documented here beyond the project linked above. From a quick Google search, it looks like this \"HelloVolla\" org is the only one using this license.\r\n\r\nGiven the non-open source nature of the license, together with limited and non-substantial use, this would not satisfy the balance of the \"Other factors\" in the [license inclusion principles](https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/blob/main/DOCS/license-inclusion-principles.md). Based on this and the other comments above, I'm going to close this issue.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2476994018/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2478504797","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2557#issuecomment-2478504797","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2557","id":2478504797,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86Tuvtd","user":{"login":"wurzer","id":7789612,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3ODk2MTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7789612?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wurzer","html_url":"https://github.com/wurzer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wurzer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wurzer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wurzer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wurzer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wurzer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wurzer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wurzer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wurzer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wurzer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-15T10:27:40Z","updated_at":"2024-11-15T10:27:40Z","body":"The Volla license was developed by Volla Systeme GmbH, my company, because we have published and will publish the source code of our Android operating system and some apps on https://github.com/HelloVolla. In the meantime, our partner is also working with the license: https://github.com/holochain-apps/relay\r\n\r\nI have made the license as simple as possible because I prefer pragmatism and comprehensibility to long legal texts. Our patent and trademark law firm had checked and approved the license.\r\n\r\nRegistering the license here is important for us at Volla because we provide apps via F-Droid. A license can only be referenced there if it is listed here. I want to offer our users transparency, which I consider to be very important. \r\n\r\nThe Volla license is used in software that is freely available and that developers can use for non-commercial, personal purposes. You will see that there are some forks of our open source projects, in the spirit of open source. \r\n\r\nThere is a lot to argue about open source. I want to avoid this discussion at this point because it is not expedient. Different opinions are possible here.  In the working group for open source of the Gesellschaft für In formatik, I had promoted my point of view on this: https://ak-oss.gi.de/mitteilung/quelloffene-software-als-motor-fuer-innovation-und-vertrauen-einer-neuen-smartphone-marke\r\n\r\nI ask you to accept the license in order to create transparency and clarity for our users and developers. The requirement for F-Droid is particularly critical. It is then still up to each user and developer to evaluate the license in detail.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2478504797/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2677002110","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2557#issuecomment-2677002110","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2557","id":2677002110,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86fj89-","user":{"login":"wurzer","id":7789612,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3ODk2MTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7789612?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wurzer","html_url":"https://github.com/wurzer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wurzer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wurzer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wurzer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wurzer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wurzer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wurzer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wurzer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wurzer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wurzer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-23T17:36:14Z","updated_at":"2025-02-23T17:36:14Z","body":"@swinslow Please reopen this ticket because we need to link the license in our F-Droid repository. It's relevant because Volla OS is on 80& of more than 15k devices in the field. Here is oour repository.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2677002110/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]